  "idea": "Fillout smart forms that pre-fill existing user data dynamically",
  "text": "Why smart forms convert three times higher than standard Google Forms. Traditional intake forms force high-intent prospects to manually type their name, company, and phone number on every screen. Forcing users to re-enter known details creates high drop-off rates and clutters your CRM with duplicate records. Instead, build Fillout forms that dynamically pull and pre-fill existing contact details directly from Airtable. You remove friction and multiply completed submissions.",
